#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:9
msgid "Configure a product and make I/O progress"
msgstr "配置产品并推进 I/O"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:11
msgid ""
"Start with the [external application tutorial](../tutorials/source-sdk.md). "
"Use the same fixed SDK or checkout for the commands below. Commands run from"
" its source root; product TOML, tasks, buffers and recovery policy stay in "
"the product repository. The resolver reports supported software choices, not"
" electrical verification of a connected board."
msgstr ""
"从[外部应用教程](../tutorials/source-sdk.md)开始。下面的命令使用同一固定 SDK 或源码检出，并从其源码根目录执行；产品 "
"TOML、任务、缓冲区与恢复策略保留在产品仓库。解析器报告支持的软件选择，不验证连接板卡的电气事实。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:17
msgid "Choose and compare a complete configuration"
msgstr "选择并比较完整配置"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:19
msgid ""
"Inspect choices before authoring a complete assembly. This query requires no"
" guessed backend or clock:"
msgstr "编写完整装配之前先查询可选项。该查询不需要猜测后端或时钟："

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:32
msgid ""
"`init` refuses an existing file. Profiles `empty`, `gpio` and `uart` write "
"visible TOML values and run the normal resolver; nonempty profiles require "
"an explicit binding. A rejected route is not replaced with another one. Read"
" the generated TOML before adopting its baud rate, event capacity, IRQ "
"priority and budgets. For an external Board, both `init` and `list-bindings`"
" accept `--board-package` instead of `--board`. The command resolves that "
"package path from the working directory; `init` writes it relative to the "
"new TOML directory. Moving the whole product tree preserves this "
"relationship. The reviewed Board package remains separate from the product "
"assembly; use the [Board porting guide](board-porting.md) for package "
"contents and provider boundaries."
msgstr ""
"`init` 拒绝已有文件。`empty`、`gpio` 和 `uart` profile 写出可见的 TOML 值并执行正常解析器；非空 "
"profile 需要显式 binding。被拒绝的路由不会替换为其他路由。采用波特率、事件容量、IRQ 优先级和预算前先阅读生成的 TOML。对外部 "
"Board，`init` 和 `list-bindings` 都接受 `--board-package` 代替 "
"`--board`。命令相对于工作目录解析包路径；`init` 将其写为相对于新 TOML 目录的路径。整体移动产品目录树仍保留这一关系。经过复核的 "
"Board 包与产品装配分开维护；包内容和 provider 边界见 [Board 接入指南](board-porting.md)。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:43
msgid ""
"The explanation lists public faces, modes, clock, resources, memory domains,"
" declared budgets and execution duties. `list-bindings --json` includes "
"`mode_contracts`, resource claims, `fact_sources` and `limitations`. A "
"binding is still `configuration-required`: backend, clock and all selected "
"instances must resolve together. Missing physical PCB facts remain unknown. "
"MCU queries state `not_established_by_configuration`; Native states "
"`not_applicable`."
msgstr ""
"解释列出公共 face、模式、时钟、资源、内存域、声明预算和执行责任。`list-bindings --json` 包含 "
"`mode_contracts`、资源声明、`fact_sources` 与 `limitations`。binding 仍为 "
"`configuration-required`：后端、时钟和全部实例必须一起通过解析。缺失的物理 PCB 事实仍未知。MCU 查询标为 "
"`not_established_by_configuration`；Native 标为 `not_applicable`。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:50
msgid ""
"Each candidate mode lists its own `resource_keys`, `occupied_resources` and "
"`resource_scope`. A polling mode does not claim the alternative DMA route. "
"Board-first queries retain known SoC and Board reservations without "
"inventing an OS owner before a backend is selected. Assembly queries read "
"facts matching the resolved input hashes. Options can add requirements, so "
"this projection does not replace full-assembly admission. Use the [exact "
"support query](../delivery/capabilities.md) to separate configuration "
"acceptance from model, ARM, SDK and physical evidence."
msgstr ""
"每个候选模式分别列出 `resource_keys`、`occupied_resources` 和 "
"`resource_scope`。轮询模式不会占用备选 DMA 路由。先选 Board 的查询保留已知 SoC 和 Board "
"预留资源，在未选择后端时不虚构 OS "
"owner。装配查询读取与解析输入哈希一致的事实。选项可能增加要求，因此该投影不能替代完整装配准入。使用[精确支持查询](../delivery/capabilities.md)区分配置接受、模型、ARM、SDK"
" 和物理证据。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:58
msgid "After editing a separate next assembly, compare effective changes:"
msgstr "编辑独立的下一份装配后，比较有效变化："

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:67
msgid ""
"Both assemblies must resolve. The diff reports effective platform, route, "
"mode, endpoint, storage and budget changes; renaming a source file alone is "
"not a behavior change. JSON distinguishes absent fields from explicit "
"`null`. Scripts that previously consumed default JSON from `explain` must "
"now pass `--json`. Editor hints are assistance; the resolver remains the "
"acceptance authority."
msgstr ""
"两份装配都必须成功解析。diff 报告有效的平台、路由、模式、端点、存储和预算变化；只重命名源文件不构成行为变化。JSON 区分缺失字段和显式 "
"`null`。以前依赖 `explain` 默认 JSON 的脚本现在必须传入 `--json`。编辑器提示仅提供帮助；解析器仍是准入权威。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:73
msgid ""
"The diff also groups `impacts` into `factory_ids`, `public_interface`, "
"`transfer_contract`, `execution` and `storage`. Each item identifies its "
"effective path, before/after value and review obligation. Changed or "
"reordered factory IDs may require consumer changes; a new executor or DMA "
"mode needs its lifecycle and storage contract reviewed. These are declared "
"configuration impacts, not measured timing, memory savings or an assertion "
"that a consumer was migrated."
msgstr ""
"diff 还把 `impacts` 分为 "
"`factory_ids`、`public_interface`、`transfer_contract`、`execution` 和 "
"`storage`。每项指出有效路径、变更前后值和审查责任。factory ID 变化或重排可能需要修改消费者；新执行者或 DMA "
"模式需要审查其生命周期和存储合同。这些是配置声明带来的影响，不是实测时序、内存节省或消费者已完成迁移的结论。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:81
msgid ""
"A conflict diagnostic identifies the authored file/key and competing "
"resource owners. Correct those inputs, then configure again. Never fix "
"generated C, weaken a DMA reservation or change a clock implicitly to make a"
" build pass. Configuration budgets are declarations; measure the actual "
"linked image before claiming resource savings. See the [assembly "
"reference](../reference/configuration/assembly.md) and [support "
"matrix](../reference/platforms/support.md)."
msgstr ""
"冲突诊断指出 authored 文件／key 及争用资源的 owner。修正这些输入后重新配置。不要修补生成 C、削弱 DMA reservation "
"或隐式改变时钟来让构建通过。配置预算是声明；宣称资源节省前必须测量实际链接镜像。见[装配参考](../reference/configuration/assembly.md)与[支持矩阵](../reference/platforms/support.md)。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:88
msgid ""
"Automation can add `--diagnostics-json` to receive one structured rejection "
"on standard error, with exit code 1; successful standard output keeps its "
"existing format. Human and JSON diagnostics use the same error record. "
"Unknown/missing fields preserve their context and key sets; resource "
"conflicts identify the resource and competing claims, including owner, mode "
"and source. These records locate authored inputs without silently correcting"
" them. CLI argument syntax errors retain argparse diagnostics and exit code "
"2."
msgstr ""
"自动化可加 `--diagnostics-json`，在标准错误中取得一条结构化拒绝记录并以状态码 1 退出；成功时的标准输出保持原有格式。人读和 "
"JSON 诊断使用同一错误记录。未知或缺失字段保留上下文和键集合；资源冲突指出资源与竞争声明，包括 owner、mode 和 "
"source。这些记录定位手写输入，不会静默修正输入。CLI 参数语法错误仍使用 argparse 诊断并以状态码 2 退出。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:96
msgid "Inspect actual build outputs"
msgstr "检查实际构建产物"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:98
msgid ""
"After a successful build, inspect its captured outputs without guessing "
"which ELF belongs to the selected configuration. Replace the path below with"
" that build's actual `quality/build-provenance.json`:"
msgstr ""
"构建成功后，查询实际捕获的输出，避免猜测哪个 ELF 属于选定配置。将下面路径替换为该次构建实际的 `quality/build-"
"provenance.json`："

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:108
msgid ""
"The command verifies the provenance and resolved identity before listing "
"source, configuration, artifact roles and the original command receipt. "
"Missing, changed, stale or mismatched inputs reject rather than becoming a "
"successful artifact view. The optional JSON path must be new. Inspection "
"neither builds nor accesses equipment, and does not grant the current "
"checkout, software or hardware a new qualification."
msgstr ""
"命令先校验 provenance 与解析身份，再列出源码、配置、产物角色和原始命令 "
"receipt。缺失、变化、陈旧或不匹配的输入必须拒绝，不能生成成功产物视图。可选 JSON 路径必须是新文件。查询不构建或访问设备，也不为当前 "
"checkout、软件或硬件建立新资格。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:115
msgid "Use optional Settings and networking mechanisms"
msgstr "使用可选 Settings 与联网机制"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:117
msgid ""
"Select `settings` in the assembly's component list to link "
"`Nexus::Settings`. The caller first opens Storage, then supplies Settings "
"metadata, a disjoint staging buffer, entry capacity and a product-defined "
"schema. Integer keys and copied byte values stay bounded. Get/set/remove "
"operate on staging; only explicit commit writes Storage, and close discards "
"uncommitted changes. Unknown schemas or corrupt loads are errors, not empty "
"writable stores. After a mutating commit failure, reopen Storage and "
"Settings to observe the surviving commit before retrying. Defaults, "
"migration, authorization and Flash regions remain product policy. Read "
"{ref}`settings.h <settings_8h>` and the [component "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/settings/README.md) for detailed ownership."
msgstr ""
"在装配的组件列表选择 `settings`，链接 `Nexus::Settings`。调用者先打开 Storage，再提供 Settings "
"元数据、独立暂存 buffer、条目容量和产品定义的 schema。整数 key 和复制的字节值保持有界。Get/set/remove "
"操作暂存；只有显式 commit 写 Storage，close 丢弃未提交变更。未知 schema 或损坏加载是错误，不是空的可写存储。发生变更性 "
"commit 失败后，先重新打开 Storage 和 Settings，观察实际保留的提交，再决定重试。默认值、迁移、授权和 Flash region "
"由产品决定。详细所有权见 {ref}`settings.h <settings_8h>` "
"与[组件合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/settings/README.md)。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:128
msgid ""
"The optional `Nexus::LwIP` target admits the organization-hosted `X-Gen-"
"Lab/lwip` 2.2.1 gitlink `77dcd25a` and its fixed source closure. It is "
"excluded from the default build until explicitly selected. It uses "
"`NO_SYS=1`: a product loop or task advances one serialized owner, without an"
" implicit RTOS stack port. It reuses Ethernet frame loans and bounded "
"memory. The reviewed slice covers static IPv4/ARP/ICMP/UDP and limited TCP "
"integration; complete TCP connection lifecycles, DHCP, DNS, IPv6, VLAN, TLS "
"and MQTT remain separate exits. Read the [network integration "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/network/README.md) for source, SDK, clock, memory and stop"
" prerequisites. Source admission and development SDK consumption do not "
"establish a software candidate, full network-platform, ARM or physical "
"acceptance."
msgstr ""
"可选 `Nexus::LwIP` 目标准入组织托管的 `X-Gen-Lab/lwip` 2.2.1 gitlink `77dcd25a` "
"与固定源码闭包。显式选择前不参与默认构建。它采用 `NO_SYS=1`，由产品循环或任务推进单一串行 owner，不隐式创建 RTOS "
"网络栈移植层。它复用 Ethernet frame 借用和有界内存。已审查切片包括静态 IPv4/ARP/ICMP/UDP 和有限 TCP 集成；完整 "
"TCP 连接生命周期、DHCP、DNS、IPv6、VLAN、TLS 和 MQTT "
"仍是独立退出。源码、SDK、clock、内存和停止前提见[联网集成合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/components/network/README.md)。源码准入和开发 SDK 消费不建立软件候选、完整联网平台、ARM 或物理资格。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:140
msgid "Assign one executor and retain borrowed storage"
msgstr "指定唯一执行者并保留借用存储"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:142
msgid ""
"The factory returns an existing typed face. Platform start, request "
"admission, progress, completion, recovery and shutdown remain separate "
"operations. Choose one execution recipe explicitly:"
msgstr ""
"factory 返回已有的 typed face。Platform "
"start、请求准入、执行推进、完成、恢复和停机仍是分开的操作。显式选择一种执行配方："

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Recipe"
msgstr "配方"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Progress owner"
msgstr "进度责任方"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Storage and shutdown responsibility"
msgstr "存储与停机责任"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Main loop"
msgstr "主循环"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"The loop calls the selected service steps; fixed IRQ entries perform bounded"
" IRQ work"
msgstr "循环调用选定的 service 步骤；固定 IRQ 入口执行有界 IRQ 工作"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"Keep request and buffers alive through settlement; stop admission, cancel or"
" drain, observe settlement, join observers, then stop"
msgstr "请求和缓冲区保持有效直至结清；关闭准入、取消或排空、观察结清、join observer，然后停止"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Exclusive task"
msgstr "独占任务"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"One product task owns direct operations; declared IRQ policy permits only "
"its selected OS interaction"
msgstr "一个产品任务拥有直接操作；声明的 IRQ 策略仅允许选定的 OS 交互"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"Wake and service explicitly; a task timeout does not revoke a borrowed "
"buffer or permit task-stack destruction"
msgstr "显式唤醒和 service；任务超时不能撤销缓冲借用，也不能允许销毁任务栈"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid "Shared bus owner"
msgstr "共享总线 owner"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"Callers submit bounded slots; one owner services the controller and "
"endpoints"
msgstr "调用者提交有界 slot；一个 owner service 控制器和端点"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:0
msgid ""
"Queue capacity, callbacks and storage are explicit; stop admission, drain "
"accepted slots and controller references, join observers, then destroy the "
"owner"
msgstr ""
"队列容量、callback 与存储显式提供；关闭准入、排空已接受的 slot 和控制器引用、join observer，然后销毁 owner"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:152
msgid ""
"These are application choices, not three hidden driver workers. Product "
"examples live in [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus-"
"examples): `templates/{native,qiming,sky,liangshan}`, "
"`apps/shared_spi_runtime` and `apps/stream_recovery`. Use their README with "
"the fixed examples revision associated with your platform. The SPI Native "
"example and FreeRTOS POSIX-host exercise are separate scopes; Native "
"Platform does not accept `backend = \"freertos\"`. A software two-CS fixture"
" does not establish a second physical CS on a launch board."
msgstr ""
"这些是应用选择，不是三个隐藏驱动 worker。产品示例位于 [nexus-examples](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus-"
"examples)：`templates/{native,qiming,sky,liangshan}`、`apps/shared_spi_runtime`"
" 和 `apps/stream_recovery`。使用与平台对应的固定示例版本及其 README。SPI Native 示例与 FreeRTOS "
"POSIX-host 演练范围不同；Native Platform 不接受 `backend = \"freertos\"`。软件双 CS "
"fixture 不能证明首发实板存在第二条 CS 接线。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:161
msgid ""
"For finite requests, REJECTED retains no caller references. ACCEPTED borrows"
" request and transfer storage until acquire-observed SETTLED. Cancel and "
"deadline expiry request progress toward withdrawal; they do not settle the "
"request. QUARANTINED preserves storage and cleanup obligations. SETTLED does"
" not imply a successful transfer or that callbacks and observers have "
"already joined. Read [ownership](../explanation/ownership.md) before placing"
" asynchronous storage on a stack or stopping a worker."
msgstr ""
"有限请求的 REJECTED 不保留调用者引用。ACCEPTED 借用请求和传输存储，直到 acquire 观察到 SETTLED。取消与 "
"deadline 到期要求向撤销引用推进，并不结清请求。QUARANTINED 保留存储及清理义务。SETTLED 不表示传输成功，也不表示 "
"callback 和 observer 已 join。在栈上放置异步存储或停止 worker "
"前先阅读[所有权](../explanation/ownership.md)。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:169
msgid ""
"For several authoritative predicates sharing one wait port, `nx_wait_select`"
" checks a caller-owned source array from an explicit cyclic start index. It "
"returns an observed-ready index without acquiring or consuming that source. "
"The caller chooses fairness by advancing the next start index, wires every "
"publisher to the same port, and owns service/timer progress. Stop and join "
"publishers and waiters before reclaiming their state. There is no implicit "
"subscription, dispatch, worker or resource transfer; the public {ref}`wait "
"contract <wait_8h>` still governs arm/recheck and the absolute deadline."
msgstr ""
"多个权威谓词共享一个 wait port 时，`nx_wait_select` 从显式循环起始索引检查调用者 source 数组。它返回观察到 "
"ready 的索引，不取得或消费对应 source。调用者推进下一次起始索引以选择公平性，把每个 publisher 接到同一 port，并负责 "
"service/timer 进度。回收状态前须停止并 join publisher 和 waiter。没有隐式订阅、派发、worker 或资源转移；公共"
" {ref}`wait 合同 <wait_8h>` 仍约束 arm/recheck 与绝对 deadline。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:178
msgid ""
"For streams, a consumer releases each acquired block explicitly. Slow "
"consumers can cause loss or stop on backpressure according to the selected "
"mode; providers must not overwrite outstanding loans. Stop may return BUSY "
"until loans and hardware references drain. Restart uses a new valid "
"lifecycle after complete stop; clearing counters is not recovery. Select "
"each F407 Board, route and continuous mode independently; one assembly does "
"not authorize another Board."
msgstr ""
"对于流，消费者显式释放每个已取得块。慢消费者可能按所选模式在背压下造成丢失或停机；provider "
"不得覆盖尚未归还的借用。在借用与硬件引用排空前，stop 可能返回 BUSY。重启必须在完整停止后进入新的有效生命周期；清零计数器不是恢复。分别选择每个"
" F407 Board、路线与连续模式；一个 assembly 不授权另一 Board。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:185
msgid "Diagnose facts without changing ownership"
msgstr "诊断事实，不改变所有权"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:187
msgid ""
"`nx_io_diagnose` in `nexus/io/diagnostic.h` composes copied request and "
"stream observations with explicitly known lifecycle, owner, service-time and"
" observer facts. It neither reads live MMIO nor invokes service or recovery."
" Its independent finding bits can coexist; `unknown_facts` preserves missing"
" information. No findings does not certify health."
msgstr ""
"`nexus/io/diagnostic.h` 中的 `nx_io_diagnose` 组合复制的 request 和 stream "
"观察，以及明确已知的生命周期、owner、service 时间与 observer 事实。它既不读取实际 MMIO，也不调用 service "
"或恢复。独立 finding 位可以并存；`unknown_facts` 保留缺失信息。没有 finding 不构成健康证明。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:193
msgid ""
"A request that stops advancing does not prove the service loop was omitted. "
"`SERVICE_OVERDUE` requires finite timestamps in the same monotonic domain "
"and a positive declared maximum gap; reversed time rejects with STATE. Owner"
" admission fields are known only after a successful owner diagnostic "
"snapshot. BUSY alone does not prove a full queue. Outstanding stream blocks "
"can be producer, ready or consumer loans; the ordinary cursor says nothing "
"about a private preposted slot. Application escalation still owns retry, "
"safe outputs and reset policy."
msgstr ""
"request 停止推进不能证明遗漏 service 循环。`SERVICE_OVERDUE` "
"需要同一单调时钟域的有限时间戳及正的最大间隔声明；时间倒退以 STATE 拒绝。只有成功取得 owner 诊断快照，准入字段才算已知。仅凭 BUSY "
"不能证明队列满。未结清 stream 块可以属于生产者、ready 或消费者；普通 cursor 不说明私有预投递 "
"slot。应用仍拥有重试、安全输出与复位策略。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:201
msgid ""
"`nx_dma_storage_validate` checks the complete explicit reservation "
"separately from its payload. For example, a 17-byte payload may use a "
"caller-owned 64-byte reservation aligned to 32-byte cache lines. The entire "
"reservation must already fit its declared DMA-visible domain and whole-line "
"ownership. The helper does not round, allocate, bounce, perform cache "
"maintenance or replace provider mode admission. Deadline expiry never "
"permits reusing the reservation before drain."
msgstr ""
"`nx_dma_storage_validate` 将完整的显式 reservation 与 payload 分开验证。例如17 字节 payload "
"可以放在调用者拥有、按32 字节 cache line 对齐的64 字节 reservation 中。完整 reservation 必须已经满足声明的 "
"DMA 可达域和完整行所有权。该函数不取整、不分配、不 bounce、不执行 cache 维护，也不替代 provider 模式准入。deadline "
"到期绝不允许在排空前重用 reservation。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:208
msgid ""
"The optional owner observation adds `accepting`, `queued` and "
"`slot_available`. Recompile consumers because its public observation/sidecar"
" layout changed. Default owner and provider structures do not gain these "
"fields. Measure optional sidecar storage for the selected ABI; it is not "
"assumed to be free."
msgstr ""
"可选 owner 观察增加 `accepting`、`queued` 和 `slot_available`。其公共 "
"observation／sidecar 布局已改变，消费方须重新编译。默认 owner 与 provider 结构不增加这些字段。按选定 ABI "
"测量可选 sidecar 存储，不能假定它没有成本。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:213
msgid "Plan daily device operations separately from qualification"
msgstr "日常设备操作计划与资格验收分开"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:215
msgid ""
"For flash/debug, use an identified equipment file and provenance from the "
"actual successful build. Monitor may run without build association:"
msgstr "对于 flash／debug，使用已识别的设备文件和实际成功构建的 provenance。Monitor 可以不关联构建："

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:227
msgid ""
"The default prints a plan. Actual execution requires `--execute --output` "
"with a new owned directory. Flash/debug require matching board/part, image, "
"probe serial and pinned tool/configuration bytes; they do not require a "
"serial console. Monitor requires the board, stable serial by-id and station "
"lock, but may omit build provenance: that result states `image_linkage = "
"unassociated`, not an image-qualified observation. Monitor uses the "
"explicitly selected host-supported standard baud rate with 8N1 and finite "
"duration; 115200 remains the default. Unknown rates or a TTY configuration "
"mismatch fail rather than selecting a different speed. Host acceptance does "
"not prove the physical device baud rate. EOF or disconnection fails. Debug "
"binds loopback. Failed or cancelled device operations retain their locks for"
" explicit inspection; normal completion releases them. A successful daily "
"operation does not qualify HIL. Until real equipment is connected, record "
"physical execution as `not_executed`. The [performance and HIL "
"guide](performance-hil.md) owns capture and qualification."
msgstr ""
"默认打印计划。实际执行要求 `--execute --output` 与新建的自有目录。Flash/debug 要求 "
"board/part、镜像、探针序列号及锁定工具/配置字节匹配，不要求串口控制台。Monitor 要求 board、稳定的 serial by-id 和"
" station lock，但可省略 build provenance；此时记录 `image_linkage = "
"unassociated`，不表示镜像已关联。Monitor 使用显式选定且主机支持的标准波特率、8N1 和有限时长；默认仍为 115200。未知速率或"
" TTY 配置不匹配必须失败，不能改用其他速度。主机接受配置不证明物理设备波特率。EOF 或断开视为失败。Debug 绑定 "
"loopback。设备操作失败或取消后保留锁等待明确检查，正常完成释放锁。日常操作成功不建立 HIL 资格。设备未接入前，物理执行记录为 "
"`not_executed`。[性能与 HIL 指南](performance-hil.md)负责采集和资格规则。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:242
msgid ""
"For one bounded Linux batch, add `--client` to `debug`. This uses the "
"official GDB/OpenOCD pipe transport and rejects `--port`; the default debug "
"server keeps its loopback TCP workflow. The target JSON must explicitly "
"identify the GDB executable in `gdb_client.tool` with `path`, `size` and "
"`sha256`. Optional `gdb_client.commands` uses the same file identity fields "
"and replaces the default `info threads` command. Review that file as "
"executable operator input. GDB starts with automatic scripts disabled, loads"
" the exact provenance-bound ELF, attaches, runs the selected commands and "
"detaches. Tool/configuration/ELF identities are checked before and after "
"execution. The finite timeout covers the owned process chain; failure or "
"cancellation withdraws it and retains station quarantine. No executable or "
"target is auto-discovered. See the [development tool "
"contract](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/dev/README.md) for the equipment schema and command example. "
"Host pipe fixtures do not establish physical probe support."
msgstr ""
"对于一次有界 Linux 批处理，在 `debug` 上增加 `--client`。它使用官方 GDB/OpenOCD 管道传输并拒绝 "
"`--port`；默认调试服务器仍保持回环 TCP 流程。目标 JSON 必须在 `gdb_client.tool` 中通过 `path`、`size`"
" 与 `sha256` 显式标识 GDB 可执行文件。可选 `gdb_client.commands` 使用相同文件身份字段，替代默认 `info "
"threads` 命令。应将该文件作为可执行操作人员输入审查。GDB 启动时禁用自动脚本，加载与 provenance 精确绑定的 "
"ELF，附加、执行所选命令后分离。执行前后检查工具、配置与 ELF 身份。有限超时覆盖拥有的进程链；失败或取消会撤回该链并保留 station "
"隔离。不会自动发现可执行文件或目标。设备 schema 与命令示例见[开发工具合同](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tools/dev/README.md)。主机管道 fixture "
"不能证明物理探针支持。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:256
msgid ""
"Development monitor remains Linux/POSIX. The session-bound terminal phases "
"are `acquiring`, `owned`, `releasing` and `released`. After confirmed helper"
" withdrawal, the parent may restore its originally held descriptor only when"
" `owned` proves this session's exclusive ownership. An already `released` "
"helper does not authorize another restore or exclusive-release operation: "
"another process may now own the terminal. Unknown, corrupt or intermediate "
"phases, unconfirmed withdrawal and identity failures retain quarantine "
"without touching another owner's terminal. The parent never opens a "
"replacement by-id device."
msgstr ""
"开发 monitor 仍限于 Linux/POSIX。会话绑定的终端 phase 为 `acquiring`、`owned`、`releasing` 和"
" `released`。确认 helper 已撤回后，只有 `owned` 证明本会话持有独占所有权时，父进程才可通过原先持有的 descriptor "
"恢复。Helper 已为 `released` 时，不授权再次恢复或清除独占：另一个进程可能已经取得终端。未知、损坏或中间 "
"phase、未确认撤回及身份错误均保留隔离，不修改其他 owner 的终端。父进程不打开 by-id 指向的替换设备。"

#: ../../../docs/guides/developer-workflow.md:265
msgid ""
"Primary I/O failure and cleanup failure remain separately visible, including"
" their exception cause/context chains; a cleanup exception must not hide an "
"earlier EOF or read failure. Independent cleanup errors remain in the "
"operation record. External SIGKILL of the parent cannot guarantee "
"restoration. The baud-rate extension does not expand formal HIL console "
"admission or establish Windows/macOS support. See the [serial ownership "
"regressions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/testing/test_dev_serial_ownership.py) and [rate/cancellation "
"regressions](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/testing/test_dev_serial_rates.py)."
msgstr ""
"主 I/O 错误与清理错误分别可见，包括各自 exception cause/context 链；清理异常不能隐藏更早的 EOF "
"或读取失败。独立清理错误保留在操作记录中。父进程遭外部 SIGKILL 时不能保证恢复。波特率扩展不扩大正式 HIL console 准入，也不建立 "
"Windows/macOS 支持。参见[串口所有权回归](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-"
"DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/testing/test_dev_serial_ownership.py)及[速率/取消回归](https://github.com/X-Gen-"
"Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-"
"SOURCE/tools/testing/test_dev_serial_rates.py)。"
